Rule 1 (valid dim index within input’s dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= (0 - ndim(v_1)) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must be floating-point for Softmin)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
>>
Rule 3 (disallow Char/int8 input to avoid unimplemented kernel)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1
>>
Rule 4 (disallow bool input to avoid negation error)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 5 (input tensor must be at least 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
